# Two Joy-Cons under padmate's default, COMBINE=0 (IN-07, ADR-0022), on
# two slots (IN-08): the events of joycon-separate. Joy-Con (L) takes
# slot 0 and holds east. Joy-Con (R) wakes and gets slot 1 at once,
# provisionally, and its tap of south, which confirms the slot, maps
# Ctrl+Z while L holds Space. L lets go of east and is switched off,
# which frees slot 0, as nobody waits; R's next tap maps on slot 1.
# The GUIDs and serials are joycon-separate's.
